Twemoji 14.0.2 regional-indicator flag faces, mapped into a project-owned
waving silhouette with restrained fold lighting. The square output tiles use
Apple-like optical geometry without including Apple artwork or font data.

Variants:
- compact: 12 / 24 / 36 px
- body: 14 / 28 / 42 px

Sources are fetched at build time from jsDelivr:
https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@14.0.2/assets/svg/

